1. Initialize the first row - 0	1	2	3	4	5
2. Reuse the same 1D array for every row for calculating the values of r,o,s
3. At the start of each row: save dp[0] into diag --> done only once for every row
4. update the first element to i, dp[0] = i --> done only once for every row (no.of operations for converting emoty to current str)
5. For the remaining elements on the row, save old dp[j] in temp, calculate new dp[j], set diag = temp for the next column
